Our Bainbridge Island community is one-of-a-kind when it comes to supporting the local efforts of our students. Spartronics 4915 would not be able to travel to Glacier Peak this weekend and future competitions without the incredible support of our Sponsors, many of which are local businesses.

![LikeUsOnFacebook_Icon](../../assets/posts/help-us-like-our-sponsors/LikeUsOnFacebook_Icon.jpg)

We want to say "THANK YOU" in a meaningful way -- by encouraging all of our teammates, mentors, parents, other family members, friends and everyone who supports our team to simply "Like" each of our Sponsor's Facebook pages.

Would you please take just two minutes right now to "Like" the Facebook pages of our Sponsors, which are below?  

